  <content>
  <section><table class="os-raise-horizontaltable">
  <thead/>
  <tbody>
    <row>
      <entry><emphasis>
        Miles from Home, \( x \)
      </emphasis></entry><entry>
        0
      </entry>
      <entry>
        5
      </entry>
      <entry>
        10
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry><emphasis>
        Miles from School, \( y \)
      </emphasis></entry><entry>
        30
      </entry>
      <entry>
        25
      </entry>
      <entry>
        20
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody>
</table>

<para>Using the table above, what is an equation that shows the relationship between miles from home and miles from school?
</para></section>
